nt pace\n    \\item \\textbf{Clinician trust} $\\to$ insufficient model explainability\n    \\item \\textbf{Economic evidence} $\\to$ limited cost-effectiveness analyses\n    \\item \\textbf{Workflow integration} $\\to$ poor fit with clinical processes\n  \\end{itemize}\n}\n\n% ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n% ROW B: rows 11–16\n% ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\n% ── Col 1: Safety & Bias ──\n\\posterbox[warningcard, title={Safety, Bias \\& Health Equity}\n]{name=safety, column=1, between=row11 and row16}{\n  \\fontsize{34}{44}\\selectfont\n  \\vspace{4pt}\n  \\colorbox{warningedge!18}{\\parbox{0.94\\linewidth}{\\centering\\vspace{8pt}\n    {\\fontsize{52}{64}\\selectfont\\bfseries\\color{warningedge} Only 18\\%}\\\\[4pt]\n    {\\fontsize{30}{38}\\selectfont of studies assessed algorithmic bias}\\\\[2pt]\n    {\\fontsize{30}{38}\\selectfont across demographic groups}\n  \\vspace{8pt}}}\n  \\vspace{10pt}\n\n  \\begin{itemize}[itemsep=10pt]\n    \\item \\textbf{5--12 pp sensitivity gaps} for underrepresented populations\n    \\item Dermatology AI trained predominantly on lighter skin tones shows largest disparities\n    \\item Adverse events in ${<}$1\\% of prospective trials, but under-reporting suspected\n  \\end{itemize}\n  \\vspace{8pt}\n\n  \\colorbox{warningedge!12}{\\parbox{0.94\\linewidth}{\\vspace{6pt}\\centering\n    {\\fontsize{30}{38}\\selectfont\\color{warningedge}\\bfseries No standardised safety-reporting}\\\\[2pt]\n    {\\fontsize{30}{38}\\selectfont\\color{warningedge}\\bfseries framework exists for AI-CDSS}\n  \\vspace{6pt}}}\n}\n\n% ── Col 2: Key Findings Summary ──\n\\posterbox[darkcard, title={Key Findings}\n]{name=findings, column=2, between=row11 and row16}{\n  \\fontsize{34}{44}\\selectfont\n  \\vspace{4pt}\n\n  \\colorbox{secondary!20}{\\parbox{0.94\\linewidth}{\\vspace{6pt}\n    {\\fontsize{32}{40}\\selectfont\\color{secondary}\\bfseries $\\blacktriangleright$ Diagnostic Accuracy}\\\\[4pt]\n    {\\fontsize{32}{40}\\selectfont AI: \\textbf{87.5\\%} sensitivity, \\textbf{93.1\\%} specificity}\\\\[2pt]\n    {\\fontsize{32}{40}\\selectfont Clinicians: \\textbf{78.2\\%} sensitivity, \\textbf{91.4\\%} specificity}\n  \\vspace{6pt}}}\n  \\vspace{8pt}\n\n  \\colorbox{accent!20}{\\parbox{0.94\\linewidth}{\\vspace{6pt}\n    {\\fontsize{32}{40}\\selectfont\\color{accent}\\bfseries $\\blacktriangleright$ Imaging Domains Lead}\\\\[4pt]\n    {\\fontsize{32}{40}\\selectfont Radiology, dermatology, ophthalmology show largest gains via deep learning}\n  \\vspace{6pt}}}\n  \\vspace{8pt}\n\n  \\colorbox{warningedge!15}{\\parbox{0.94\\linewidth}{\\vspace{6pt}\n    {\\fontsize{32}{40}\\selectfont\\color{warningedge}\\bfseries $\\blacktriangleright$ Equity Gap}\\\\[4pt]\n    {\\fontsize{32}{40}\\selectfont 82\\% of studies lack any demographic bias audit}\n  \\vspace{6pt}}}\n  \\vspace{8pt}\n\n  \\colorbox{primary!18}{\\parbox{0.94\\linewidth}{\\vspace{6pt}\n    {\\fontsize{32}{40}\\selectfont\\color{primary}\\bfseries $\\blacktriangleright$ Translation Bottleneck}\\\\[4pt]\n    {\\fontsize{32}{40}\\selectfont $<$5\\% of published models validated prospectively in real-world settings}\n  \\vspace{6pt}}}\n}\n\n% ── Col 3: Sensitivity Comparison Visual ──\n\\posterbox[bluecard, title={AI vs.\\ Clinician Sensitivity by Domain}\n]{name=senscomp, column=3, between=row11 and row16}{\n  \\fontsize{34}{44}\\selectfont\n  \\vspace{6pt}\n\n  % Radiology\n  {\\fontsize{32}{40}\\selectfont\\bfseries Radiology}\\\\[4pt]\n  \\colorbox{secondary!25}{\\parbox{0.82\\linewidth}{\\vspace{3pt}\\hfill{\\fontsize{32}{38}\\selectfont\\bfseries\\color{white} AI: 89.3\\%}\\vspace{3pt}}}\\\\[2pt]\n  \\colorbox{primary!15}{\\parbox{0.72\\linewidth}{\\vspace{3pt}\\hfill{\\fontsize{32}{38}\\selectfont\\color{textgray} Clin: 79.8\\%}\\vspace{3pt}}}\\\\[10pt]\n\n  % Dermatology\n  {\\fontsize{32}{40}\\selectfont\\bfseries Dermatology}\\\\[4pt]\n  \\colorbox{secondary!25}{\\parbox{0.79\\linewidth}{\\vspace{3pt}\\hfill{\\fontsize{32}{38}\\selectfont\\bfseries\\color{white} AI: 86.7\\%}\\vspace{3pt}}}\\\\[2pt]\n  \\colorbox{primary!15}{\\parbox{0.68\\linewidth}{\\vspace{3pt}\\hfill{\\fontsize{32}{38}\\selectfont\\color{textgray} Clin: 76.5\\%}\\vspace{3pt}}}\\\\[10pt]\n\n  % Ophthalmology\n  {\\fontsize{32}{40}\\selectfont\\bfseries Ophthalmology}\\\\[4pt]\n  \\colorbox{secondary!25}{\\parbox{0.84\\linewidth}{\\vspace{3pt}\\hfill{\\fontsize{32}{38}\\selectfont\\bfseries\\color{white} AI: 90.1\\%}\\vspace{3pt}}}\\\\[2pt]\n  \\colorbox{primary!15}{\\parbox{0.76\\linewidth}{\\vspace{3pt}\\hfill{\\fontsize{32}{38}\\selectfont\\color{textgray} Clin: 82.3\\%}\\vspace{3pt}}}\\\\[10pt]\n\n  % Pathology\n  {\\fontsize{32}{40}\\selectfont\\bfseries Pathology}\\\\[4pt]\n  \\colorbox{secondary!25}{\\parbox{0.77\\linewidth}{\\vspace{3pt}\\hfill{\\fontsize{32}{38}\\selectfont\\bfseries\\color{white} AI: 84.0\\%}\\vspace{3pt}}}\\\\[2pt]\n  \\colorbox{primary!15}{\\parbox{0.66\\linewidth}{\\vspace{3pt}\\hfill{\\fontsize{32}{38}\\selectfont\\color{textgray} Clin: 74.1\\%}\\vspace{3pt}}}\n  \\vspace{6pt}\n\n  \\centering\n  {\\fontsize{28}{34}\\selectfont\\color{textgray}\\textit{Bar widths proportional to sensitivity values}}\n}\n\n% ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n% ROW C: rows 16–20\n% ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\n% ── Col 1: Study Scope ──\n\\posterbox[redcard, title={Study Scope \\& Methods}\n]{name=scope, column=1, between=row16 and row20}{\n  \\fontsize{34}{44}\\selectfont\n  \\vspace{4pt}\n  \\begin{itemize}[itemsep=10pt]\n    \\item Systematic review: \\textbf{400+ studies}\n    \\item Domains: radiology, dermatology, ophthalmology, pathology\n    \\item Metrics: sensitivity, specificity, turnaround time, bias reporting\n    \\item Source: \\textit{The Lancet Digital Health} (2023)\n  \\end{itemize}\n  \\vspace{10pt}\n  \\colorbox{primary!18}{\\parbox{0.94\\linewidth}{\\vspace{6pt}\\centering\n    {\\fontsize{30}{38}\\selectfont\\color{primary} Covers diagnostic, prognostic,}\\\\[2pt]\n    {\\fontsize{30}{38}\\selectfont\\color{primary} and therapeutic AI-CDSS applications}\n  \\vspace{6pt}}}\n}\n\n% ── Col 2: Recommendations ──\n\\posterbox[darkcard, title={Recommendations}\n]{name=recs, column=2, between=row16 and row20}{\n  \\fontsize{33}{43}\\selectfont\n  \\vspace{4pt}\n  \\begin{enumerate}[itemsep=8pt]\n    \\item \\textbf{Mandate prospective validation} including multi-site, diverse-population trials\n    \\item \\textbf{Standardise bias auditing} via demographic-stratified reporting requirements\n    \\item \\textbf{Develop safety registries} analogous to pharmacovigilance systems\n    \\item \\textbf{Invest in interoperability} through open standards (FHIR, OMOP)\n    \\item \\textbf{Prioritise explainability} to build clinician and patient trust\n  \\end{enumerate}\n}\n\n% ── Col 3: Key Takeaways ──\n\\posterbox[highlightcard, title={Key Takeaways}\n]{name=takeaways, column=3, between=row16 and row20}{\n  \\fontsize{34}{44}\\selectfont\n  \\vspace{4pt}\n\n  \\colorbox{white!90!primary}{\\parbox{0.94\\linewidth}{\\vspace{8pt}\n    {\\fontsize{34}{42}\\selectfont\\color{primary}\\bfseries 1.}\\hspace{4pt}\n    {\\fontsize{34}{42}\\selectfont AI demonstrates \\textbf{meaningful diagnostic gains} over standard clinical workflows across imaging domains}\n  \\vspace{8pt}}}\n  \\vspace{6pt}\n\n  \\colorbox{white!90!primary}{\\parbox{0.94\\linewidth}{\\vspace{8pt}\n    {\\fontsize{34}{42}\\selectfont\\color{warningedge}\\bfseries 2.}\\hspace{4pt}\n    {\\fontsize{34}{42}\\selectfont The \\textbf{$<$5\\% prospective validation rate} reveals a critical implementation gap between research and practice}\n  \\vspace{8pt}}}\n  \\vspace{6pt}\n\n  \\colorbox{white!90!primary}{\\parbox{0.94\\linewidth}{\\vspace{8pt}\n    {\\fontsize{34}{42}\\selectfont\\color{warningedge}\\bfseries 3.}\\hspace{4pt}\n    {\\fontsize{34}{42}\\selectfont \\textbf{Bias assessment remains rare} — coordinated action across research, regulatory, and delivery ecosystems is essential}\n  \\vspace{8pt}}}\n}\n\n\\end{tcbposter}\n\\end{document}\n", "numLines": 384, "startLine": 1, "totalLines": 384}}

